@api = http://localhost:5000

### API dang chay - 200
GET {{api}}/

### Danh sach bai tap - 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Chi tiet bai tap 1 - 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### Bai tap khong ton tai - 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### ID khong phai so - 404 body rong
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/abc

### Nop bai hop le - 201 va Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api" }

### Doc lai luot nop - 200 (gui createSubmission truoc)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Luot nop khong ton tai - 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Du lieu rong - 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "", "repositoryUrl": "" }

### Thieu repositoryUrl - 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001" }

### Nop vao bai khong ton tai - 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api" }

### Nop vao bai da dong - 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api" }

### Thieu Content-Type - 415
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api" }

### JSON sai cu phap - 400
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001",

### Phuong thuc khong ho tro - 405 va Allow GET
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1
